---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — RBT Practice Exam"
  description="Privacy Policy for rbtpracticeexam.xyz. We prioritize your privacy with client-side progress tracking and zero mandatory account creation."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-8 animate-fadeIn">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">
        Legal & Transparency
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Last Updated: August 2026 • rbtpracticeexam.xyz
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Introduction & Open Access Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>RBT Practice Exam</strong> (accessible from <code>https://rbtpracticeexam.xyz</code>), your privacy is our core priority. We operate an open-access educational model: you are never required to create an account, provide an email address, or enter personal billing information to practice questions or take mock exams.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Local Browser Storage (IndexedDB & LocalStorage)</h2>
        <p>
          To track your study session streaks, flashcard SuperMemo-2 intervals, and exam scores, our application stores your progress locally on your device using client-side IndexedDB and LocalStorage. This data remains on your browser and is not collected, sold, or shared with third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Log Files & Anonymous Telemetry</h2>
        <p>
          Like standard web platforms, our hosting servers (Cloudflare Workers) may automatically log non-identifiable technical information such as browser user-agent, request timestamp, and HTTP response codes to maintain server stability, security, and rate-limiting.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Cookies & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use tracking cookies for marketing or profiling. Essential cookies are strictly limited to administrator authentication sessions and dark/light UI theme preferences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, you can reach out via our contact page or email us directly at: <a href="mailto:support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 font-bold underline">support@rbtpracticeexam.xyz</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
